concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-17 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "17 ACMA to consult ACCC in relation to management of electronic"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-17 ;
    values:originalText "addressing The ACMA must consult the Australian Competition and Consumer Commission before carrying out an act: (a) for the purpose of performing its functions under paragraph 11(1)(a) or (b); and (b) that would, in the ACMA’s opinion, have a significant effect on competition or consumer protection.   ACMA’s membership  Part 3 Membership  Division 2 Section 19 Australian Communications and Media Authority Act 2005 Compilation date: 05/12/2025" ;
    skos:definition "addressing The ACMA must consult the Australian Competition and Consumer Commission before carrying out an act: (a) for the purpose of performing its functions under paragraph 11(1)(a) or (b); and (b) that would, in the ACMA’s opinion, have a significant effect on competition or consumer protection.   ACMA’s membership  Part 3 Membership  Division 2 Section 19 Australian Communications and Media Authority Act 2005 Compilation date: 05/12/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1c4d26bf0ccc51c2df0916a62d646cee62f54bd3fa864f1f1b84c9358e44d204" ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer ;
