concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-25-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "25(3) Period of appointment for associate members"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-25-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Despite subsection (1), if:   ACMA’s membership  Part 3 Membership  Division 2 Section 25 Australian Communications and Media Authority Act 2005 Compilation date: 05/12/2025 (a) an associate member’s instrument of appointment specifies that the appointment relates to a specified inquiry, investigation or hearing; and (b) the inquiry, investigation or hearing ends before the end of the period described in subsection (1); the associate member holds office until the end of the inquiry, investigation or hearing. Extension to complete inquiry, investigation or hearing" ;
    skos:definition "(3) Despite subsection (1), if:   ACMA’s membership  Part 3 Membership  Division 2 Section 25 Australian Communications and Media Authority Act 2005 Compilation date: 05/12/2025 (a) an associate member’s instrument of appointment specifies that the appointment relates to a specified inquiry, investigation or hearing; and (b) the inquiry, investigation or hearing ends before the end of the period described in subsection (1); the associate member holds office until the end of the inquiry, investigation or hearing. Extension to complete inquiry, investigation or hearing"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d70ec5d09ba0036e3d071027be268e5bba8c67918e9c5d308ba7e8f7d4fe0801" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-25 ;
    cof:pageNumber "26"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Associate members hold office until the end of an inquiry, investigation or hearing if specified in their appointment." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005.pdf> ;
    dc:source "australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005.pdf, p.26" ;
    cml:asserts concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-25-ss-3-norm .
