concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-27 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "27 Associate members to be treated as members for certain purposes"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-27 ;
    values:originalText "in other Acts (1) For the purposes of a reference in an Act other than this Act to a member of the ACMA, an associate member is taken to be a member for all purposes in connection with any inquiry, investigation, hearing or other matter specified in his or her instrument of appointment. (2) Subsection (1) is subject to a contrary intention in the other Act.   ACMA’s membership  Part 3 Terms and conditions for members and associate members  Division 3 Section 28 Australian Communications and Media Authority Act 2005 Compilation date: 05/12/2025" ;
    skos:definition "in other Acts (1) For the purposes of a reference in an Act other than this Act to a member of the ACMA, an associate member is taken to be a member for all purposes in connection with any inquiry, investigation, hearing or other matter specified in his or her instrument of appointment. (2) Subsection (1) is subject to a contrary intention in the other Act.   ACMA’s membership  Part 3 Terms and conditions for members and associate members  Division 3 Section 28 Australian Communications and Media Authority Act 2005 Compilation date: 05/12/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6cdfea3c4d36c4daccb6bba2d2ff49b9aa50dddc328c2b68b83ae7774217564d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer ;
