    cof:title "35 Other terms and conditions" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "A member or associate member holds office on the terms and conditions (if any) in relation to matters not covered by this Act that are determined by the appointer.   Decision-making and delegation by ACMA  Part 4 Meetings  Division 1 Section 36 Australian Communications and Media Authority Act 2005 Compilation date: 05/12/2025" ;
    cof:pageNumber "32"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-36 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "36 Times and places of meetings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-36 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The ACMA is to hold such meetings as are necessary for the efficient performance of its functions. (2) Meetings are to be held at such times and places as the ACMA decides. This subsection has effect subject to subsections (3) and (4). (3) The Chair may call a meeting at any time. (4) The Chair must call a meeting if requested to do so in writing by: (a) the Minister; or (b) at least 2 other members." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The ACMA is to hold such meetings as are necessary for the efficient performance of its functions. (2) Meetings are to be held at such times and places as the ACMA decides. This subsection has effect subject to subsections (3) and (4). (3) The Chair may call a meeting at any time. (4) The Chair must call a meeting if requested to do so in writing by: (a) the Minister; or (b) at least 2 other members."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "68b450c151ecf714882ef3f473945a0a8ea80c327aa83907cef9990d16ac0289" ;
