concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-42 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "42 Conduct of meetings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-42 ;
    values:originalText "The ACMA may, subject to this Division, regulate proceedings at its meetings as it considers appropriate. Note: Section 33B of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901 provides for participation in meetings by telephone etc." ;
    skos:definition "The ACMA may, subject to this Division, regulate proceedings at its meetings as it considers appropriate. Note: Section 33B of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901 provides for participation in meetings by telephone etc."@en ;
