concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-44-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44(4) Decisions without meetings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of a particular proposed decision, this section applies to an associate member as if the associate member were a member, if that proposed decision relates to a matter connected with an inquiry, investigation, hearing or other matter specified in the associate member’s instrument of appointment." ;
    skos:definition "(4) For the purposes of a particular proposed decision, this section applies to an associate member as if the associate member were a member, if that proposed decision relates to a matter connected with an inquiry, investigation, hearing or other matter specified in the associate member’s instrument of appointment."@en ;
