concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-54 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "54 Staff"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-54 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The staff of the ACMA are to be persons engaged under the Public Service Act 1999. (2) For the purposes of the Public Service Act 1999: (a) the Chair and the ACMA staff together constitute a Statutory Agency; and (b) the Chair is the Head of that Statutory Agency." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The staff of the ACMA are to be persons engaged under the Public Service Act 1999. (2) For the purposes of the Public Service Act 1999: (a) the Chair and the ACMA staff together constitute a Statutory Agency; and (b) the Chair is the Head of that Statutory Agency."@en ;
