concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-59db a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "59DB Disclosure of information that relates to the Scams Prevention"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-59db ;
    values:originalText "Framework An ACMA official authorised by the Chair, in writing, for the purposes of this section may disclose authorised disclosure information if the disclosure: (a) is to: (i) an SPF regulator (within the meaning of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010); or (ii) the operator of an SPF EDR scheme (within the meaning of that Act); and (b) is for the purposes of the operation (including enforcement) of the SPF provisions (within the meaning of that Act)." ;
    skos:definition "Framework An ACMA official authorised by the Chair, in writing, for the purposes of this section may disclose authorised disclosure information if the disclosure: (a) is to: (i) an SPF regulator (within the meaning of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010); or (ii) the operator of an SPF EDR scheme (within the meaning of that Act); and (b) is for the purposes of the operation (including enforcement) of the SPF provisions (within the meaning of that Act)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "713e7ddbe5acf7256d7f20b7d6c7ba5aeaf109759f326ea54e16c64c1b186d55" ;
    cof:pageNumber "58"^^xsd:integer ;
