    cof:title "59F(2) Disclosure of publicly available information" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of this section, an ACMA official is taken to disclose information if the information is published by the ACMA: (a) on the ACMA’s website; or (b) in any other way.   Disclosure of information  Part 7A  Section 59G Australian Communications and Media Authority Act 2005 Compilation date: 05/12/2025" ;
