concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-63 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "63 Chair not subject to direction by ACMA on certain matters"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-63 ;
    values:originalText "The Chair is not subject to direction by the ACMA in relation to the Chair’s performance of functions, or exercise of powers, under the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 or the Public Service Act 1999." ;
