concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-64 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "64 Definitions determination"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-64 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The ACMA may make a written determination defining 1 or more expressions used in specified instruments, being instruments that are made by the ACMA under 1 or more specified laws of the Commonwealth. (2) If the Minister is authorised to make an instrument under a law specified in a determination under subsection (1), the instrument may make provision for or in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating, with or without modification, the provisions of a determination under subsection (1) as in force from time to time." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The ACMA may make a written determination defining 1 or more expressions used in specified instruments, being instruments that are made by the ACMA under 1 or more specified laws of the Commonwealth. (2) If the Minister is authorised to make an instrument under a law specified in a determination under subsection (1), the instrument may make provision for or in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating, with or without modification, the provisions of a determination under subsection (1) as in force from time to time."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f6188b8f69afd4339b9b741b740b934f57af999786029491ebe1f7f669ce3592" ;
    cof:pageNumber "63"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-64-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-64-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005.pdf> ;
    dc:source "australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005.pdf, p.63" .
